#!/usr/bin/env python3

"""gra - Git Repo Admin

A tiny worktree-first clone helper that puts repositories under a flat ~/gra
layout. Each repository lives in a bare checkout, and work happens in
short-named worktrees next to it:

    ~/gra/<repo>/.bare
    ~/gra/<repo>/<word>

Worktree names are short random words, unique across all repositories, and
unrelated to the branch they have checked out: switch branches freely inside a
worktree, or start a new one and remove it when done.
"""

